{"slug":"research/end-subset-conversations","title":"Claude Opus 4 and 4.1 can end certain conversations \\ Anthropic","desc":"Claude Opus 4 and 4.1 can now end a rare subset of conversations. An update on our exploratory research on model welfare.","main":"<div class=\"\"><article class=\"EaEYjq_Article\" style=\"opacity:1\"><header class=\"VYxBBq_Header\" style=\"visibility: visible; translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate(0px, 0px); opacity: 1;\"><div class=\"VYxBBq_Content\"><h1 class=\"VYxBBq_Title\">Claude Opus 4 and 4.1 can now end a rare subset of conversations</h1></div><div class=\"VYxBBq_Cover\"><div class=\"VYxBBq_CoverContainer\"><img alt=\"Claude Opus 4 and 4.1 can now end a rare subset of conversations\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"870\" height=\"489.375\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"VYxBBq_CoverImage\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/sites/anthropic/pages-assets/2db15a21c1c7771f0b84.jpg\"></div></div><div class=\"VYxBBq_MetalistContainer\" style=\"--metalist-columns:3\"><ul class=\"VYxBBq_Metalist\"><li class=\"VYxBBq_Metadata\"><p class=\"text-caption-1\">Published</p><p class=\"text-caption-1\"><time datetime=\"2025-08-15\">Aug 15, 2025</time></p></li><li class=\"VYxBBq_Metadata\"><p class=\"text-caption-1\">Team</p><p class=\"text-caption-1\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" href=\"/research/team/alignment\">Alignment</a></p></li><li class=\"VYxBBq_Metadata\"><p class=\"text-caption-1\">Topics</p><ul class=\"VYxBBq_Wrap\"><li class=\"\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=model-welfare\">Model welfare</a></li><li class=\"\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=claude-opus\">Claude Opus</a></li><li class=\"VYxBBq_ThirdTopic\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=claude-apps\">Claude apps</a></li><li class=\"VYxBBq_HiddenTopic\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=safeguards\">Safeguards</a></li><li class=\"VYxBBq